>p</text><line x1=\"68\" y1=\"97\" x2=\"108\" y2=\"97\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><path d=\"M99.2,91.9 L108.0,97.0 L99.2,102.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"88\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">kết hợp</text><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"97\" r=\"31\" fill=\"rgba(52,211,153,.12)\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"85\" r=\"11\" fill=\"rgba(56,189,248,.22)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">p</text><circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"85\" r=\"11\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,.25)\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"90\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">n</text><circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"109\" r=\"11\" fill=\"rgba(148,163,184,.25)\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"114\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">n</text><circle cx=\"158\" cy=\"109\" r=\"11\" fill=\"rgba(56,189,248,.22)\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"158\" y=\"114\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">p</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">He-4 = 2p + 2n</text><line x1=\"179\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"70\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M188.6,71.1 L198.0,70.0 L194.2,78.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"74\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">2e<tspan baseline-shift=\"super\" font-size=\"11\">+</tspan></text><line x1=\"179\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"198\" y2=\"124\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M194.2,115.3 L198.0,124.0 L188.6,122.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"130\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">2 neutrino</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"182\" fill=\"#fb923c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">toả 26,7 MeV</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"202\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">điện tích: 4 = 2 (He) + 2 (e⁺)</text><text x=\"366\" y=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">b) Mặt trời</text><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"100\" r=\"42\" fill=\"rgba(251,146,60,.16)\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"409.4\" y1=\"118.0\" x2=\"417.7\" y2=\"121.4\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"384.0\" y1=\"143.4\" x2=\"387.4\" y2=\"151.7\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"348.0\" y1=\"143.4\" x2=\"344.6\" y2=\"151.7\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"322.6\" y1=\"118.0\" x2=\"314.3\" y2=\"121.4\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"322.6\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"314.3\" y2=\"78.6\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"348.0\" y1=\"56.6\" x2=\"344.6\" y2=\"48.3\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"384.0\" y1=\"56.6\" x2=\"387.4\" y2=\"48.3\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><line x1=\"409.4\" y1=\"82.0\" x2=\"417.7\" y2=\"78.6\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" opacity=\"1\"/><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"100\" r=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(251,146,60,.40)\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"366\" y=\"105\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lõi</text><line x1=\"393.6\" y1=\"127.6\" x2=\"380.8\" y2=\"114.8\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M383.3,124.0 L380.8,114.8 L390.0,117.3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"338.4\" y1=\"127.6\" x2=\"351.2\" y2=\"114.8\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M342.0,117.3 L351.2,114.8 L348.7,124.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"338.4\" y1=\"72.4\" x2=\"351.2\" y2=\"85.2\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M348.7,76.0 L351.2,85.2 L342.0,82.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"393.6\" y1=\"72.4\" x2=\"380.8\" y2=\"85.2\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M390.0,82.7 L380.8,85.2 L383.3,76.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f87171\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"366\" y=\"182\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lõi ~15 triệu K</text><text x=\"366\" y=\"202\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">hấp dẫn ép vào lõi</text></svg></figure>"
